Bundle-Name: Fennec OData Wire Profile API
Bundle-Description: SPI for the wire profile of a service root (ADR-0010): an OData dialect such as OGC SensorThings renames the control information, keeps the key out of the body, writes absolute self and navigation links and its own root document — selected per root by configuration, plain OData by default

-library: enableEMF

src=${^src},src-gen

# The wire mapping (#119): the model a profile hands over, generated into src-gen
-includeresource.model: model=model
-generate:\
	model/wire-mapping.genmodel;\
		generate=fennecEMF;\
		genmodel=model/wire-mapping.genmodel;\
		output=src-gen
